trading volume of the Company Common Stock or Indebtedness, in and of itself; (xi) any failure by the Company to meet financial performance or results of operations expectations; provided further, that with respect to clauses (i) through (vi) and (ix), such Effects shall be taken into account in determining whether a 'Material Adverse Effect' has occurred to the extent that such Effect has had a disproportionate adverse effect on the Company relative to other companies in the same industry. (Pages 10-11)
